+              <dt pn="section-3.2-6.6.1.1">24:</dt>
+              <dd pn="section-3.2-6.6.1.2">Virtual path switching is not supported on this input port.</dd>
+              <dt pn="section-3.2-6.6.1.3">25:</dt>
