+                <t indent="0" pn="section-3.2-6.10.1.4.1">One or more of the specified ports is down.</t>
+                <t indent="0" pn="section-3.2-6.10.1.4.2">A port is down if its Port Status is Unavailable.
+Connection Management, Connection State, Port Management,
